# Binary files — never diff, never convert line endings
*.dds binary
*.tga binary
*.ogg binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary

# Text files — normalize to LF in repo, native on checkout
*.txt text
*.yml text
*.md text
*.mod text
*.gfx text
*.gui text
*.lua text
*.shader text
*.fxh text
*.asset text
